sequenceDiagram
  participant B as Browser
  participant A as FastAPI
  participant O as OrderService
  participant DB as Database
  B->>A: POST /orders + Idempotency-Key
  A->>O: checkout(user, payload, key)
  O->>DB: lookup user/key/request_hash
  alt replay
    DB-->>O: original order
    O-->>A: original order
  else first request
    O->>DB: lock inventory and validate SKU/price
    O->>DB: create order/items/payment and decrement stock
    O->>DB: save idempotency record
    DB-->>O: committed order
    O-->>A: new order
  end
  A-->>B: uniform ApiResponse
